nd":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#13","rawText":"反而是自以為掌控他人的人，往往才會陷入自己規則的泥淖。","displayText":"反而是自以為掌控他人的人，往往才會陷入自己規則的泥淖。","spans":[{"text":"反而是自以為掌控他人的人，往往才會陷入自己規則的泥淖。"}]}],"next":"23winter_s15_2#14"},"23winter_s15_2#14":{"id":"23winter_s15_2#14","act":14,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":"聖餐","rawName":"<color=#C0FF3E>聖餐</color>","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"<color=#C0FF3E>유카리스트</color>"},"units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#14","rawText":"因為教授是人類吧。即便是機械，也是如此嗎？","displayText":"因為教授是人類吧。即便是機械，也是如此嗎？","spans":[{"text":"因為教授是人類吧。即便是機械，也是如此嗎？"}]}],"next":"23winter_s15_2#15"},"23winter_s15_2#15":{"id":"23winter_s15_2#15","act":15,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#15","rawText":"我有些驚訝地看向聖餐。她托著臉微笑地看著我，絲毫不覺得自己的發言有何不妥。","displayText":"我有些驚訝地看向聖餐。她托著臉微笑地看著我，絲毫不覺得自己的發言有何不妥。","spans":[{"text":"我有些驚訝地看向聖餐。她托著臉微笑地看著我，絲毫不覺得自己的發言有何不妥。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":4,"delay":0,"duration":0.6,"alpha":0},{"imgId":1,"delay":0.6,"duration":0.6,"alpha":1}]},"next":"23winter_s15_2#16"},"23winter_s15_2#16":{"id":"23winter_s15_2#16","act":16,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#16","rawText":"……也是如此。","displayText":"……也是如此。","spans":[{"text":"……也是如此。"}]}],"next":"23winter_s15_2#17"},"23winter_s15_2#17":{"id":"23winter_s15_2#17","act":17,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#17","rawText":"深思熟慮後，我將手從白后上拿開，轉向了一枚白象。","displayText":"深思熟慮後，我將手從白后上拿開，轉向了一枚白象。","spans":[{"text":"深思熟慮後，我將手從白后上拿開，轉向了一枚白象。"}]}],"next":"23winter_s15_2#18"},"23winter_s15_2#18":{"id":"23winter_s15_2#18","act":18,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"23winter_s15_2#18","rawText":"我相信每一個智慧體都擁有自由意志。","displayText":"我相信每一個智慧體都擁有自由意志。","spans":[{"text":"我相信